## Key Features
- 🚀 **Multiple Modes**: Web, Email, Document, AMP Web, Classic
- 🎨 **Rich Styling**: Colors, gradients, borders, shadows, fonts
- 📱 **Responsive**: Auto-width, mobile-optimized sizes  
